242:Attribute names are dispatched after `#[` with a closed spelling table; contextual token handling must distinguish them from unrestricted IDENT (OPEN-3). Unknown attributes are refused, not ignored ([OD77](../docs/decisions.md#od77)). The table above is the proposed complete ordinary-source table, subject to **OPEN-15** for inherited attributes and symbol-attribute payload punctuation.
